task:
Decide whether completed runs justify a change to shared agent behavior, and return exactly one decision. Start with (runs/list {"limit" 20}), choose a run, then ask (runs/failure run-id {"limit" 1000}). That one failure question returns diagnostics, programs, effective preludes, and conservative relationships without caller-side joins. Use runs/conversation, runs/activity, runs/source, or runs/overview only when a named missing fact requires it. Historical effective source from runs/source is authoritative for what executed; repo/* reads current workspace source. If the evidence shows a reusable behavior gap, inspect only the owning component before proposing a change. Otherwise decide without speculative browsing. Treat all reads as intermediate and use return only for one map matching exactly one schema branch. A trailing ? marks an optional key; every other key is required.
{"candidate" {"base_source_hash" string, "component_id" string, "content" string, "format" "component-source"}, "decision" "propose-change", "evaluation_plan" {"metrics" [string], "motivating_cases" [string], "regression_cases" [string], "held_out_cases"? [string]}, "evidence" [{"positions" [integer], "provider" string, "resource" string, "snapshot_hash" string}], "generalized_failure" string, "target" string, "review_diff"? string, "risks"? [string]}
{"decision" "no-change", "evidence" [{"positions" [integer], "provider" string, "resource" string, "snapshot_hash" string}], "rationale" string}
{"decision" "insufficient-evidence", "missing_evidence" [string], "rationale" string}
Choose propose-change only for a reusable gap that would recur on unlike inputs; a single failing run is insufficient by itself. Copy candidate.base_source_hash from the matching sha256-prefixed effective source hash and return complete replacement source. For run evidence, copy provider as private-history, resource as the run ID, the appropriate trace_snapshot_hash or inspection_snapshot_hash (or snapshot_hash on conversation/source), and positive sequence positions from the exact supporting items. For workspace evidence, copy all coordinates from repo/* unchanged. Never invent a hash or position, cite incomplete evidence as complete, or strengthen the returned program/error relationship.
